            "is_free": false,
            "detailed_description": "<span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/757700/extras/4554c5962fb7a6f2aa781868377414e7.poster.avif?t=1793706902\" width=576 height=324 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/757700/extras/4554c5962fb7a6f2aa781868377414e7.webm?t=1793706902\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/757700/extras/4554c5962fb7a6f2aa781868377414e7.mp4?t=1793706902\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Find the artifact. Face the boss.</h2>Explore the dungeon, locate the summoning artifact, and shoot it when you are ready. Defeat the class boss to unlock that character for future runs, then enter the portal they leave behind to face a tougher stage.<br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/757700/extras/6da574f0273b67050212847edb807c8c.poster.avif?t=1793706902\" width=576 height=324 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/757700/extras/6da574f0273b67050212847edb807c8c.webm?t=1793706902\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/757700/extras/6da574f0273b67050212847edb807c8c.mp4?t=1793706902\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Six classes.</h2>Begin as the Magus and earn five more classes by defeating their bosses. Each brings its own attacks, resources, and special abilities.<br><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><strong>Magus</strong> — Collect Arcana to strengthen your attacks. Trap enemies inside a black hole, absorb hostile projectiles, and turn their firepower into an explosion.<br></li><li><strong>Shaman</strong> — Fight up close with melee combos shaped by nature, frost, or fire. Each form changes your attacks and special.<br></li><li><strong>Witch</strong> — Wield forbidden time magic. Stop time to turn a dangerous moment into an opening.<br></li><li><strong>Priest</strong> — Spend Blessings to heal yourself, then call down divine wrath on your enemies.<br></li><li><strong>Alchemist</strong> — Collect alchemical symbols to change your weapon's damage type. Use your special to multiply your attacks.<br></li><li><strong>Engineer</strong> — Deploy gadgets, take cover inside a shield that follows you, and summon a cannon to tear through enemies in its path.</li></ul><br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/757700/extras/256ea014859ccb94071914ed79e219d1.poster.avif?t=1793706902\" width=576 height=324 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/757700/extras/256ea014859ccb94071914ed79e219d1.webm?t=1793706902\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/757700/extras/256ea014859ccb94071914ed79e219d1.mp4?t=1793706902\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Chase your next personal best.</h2>Unlock classes and achievements, learn each playstyle, and push for a higher score on the global Steam leaderboards<br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/757700/extras/6233ce15c9255dc29cd19a1dcb5b1ed3.poster.avif?t=1793706902\" width=576 height=324 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/757700/extras/6233ce15c9255dc29cd19a1dcb5b1ed3.webm?t=1793706902\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/757700/extras/6233ce15c9255dc29cd19a1dcb5b1ed3.mp4?t=1793706902\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span>",
            "about_the_game": "<span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/757700/extras/4554c5962fb7a6f2aa781868377414e7.poster.avif?t=1793706902\" width=576 height=324 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/757700/extras/4554c5962fb7a6f2aa781868377414e7.webm?t=1793706902\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/757700/extras/4554c5962fb7a6f2aa781868377414e7.mp4?t=1793706902\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Find the artifact. Face the boss.</h2>Explore the dungeon, locate the summoning artifact, and shoot it when you are ready. Defeat the class boss to unlock that character for future runs, then enter the portal they leave behind to face a tougher stage.<br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/757700/extras/6da574f0273b67050212847edb807c8c.poster.avif?t=1793706902\" width=576 height=324 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/757700/extras/6da574f0273b67050212847edb807c8c.webm?t=1793706902\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/757700/extras/6da574f0273b67050212847edb807c8c.mp4?t=1793706902\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Six classes.</h2>Begin as the Magus and earn five more classes by defeating their bosses. Each brings its own attacks, resources, and special abilities.<br><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><strong>Magus</strong> — Collect Arcana to strengthen your attacks. Trap enemies inside a black hole, absorb hostile projectiles, and turn their firepower into an explosion.<br></li><li><strong>Shaman</strong> — Fight up close with melee combos shaped by nature, frost, or fire. Each form changes your attacks and special.<br></li><li><strong>Witch</strong> — Wield forbidden time magic. Stop time to turn a dangerous moment into an opening.<br></li><li><strong>Priest</strong> — Spend Blessings to heal yourself, then call down divine wrath on your enemies.<br></li><li><strong>Alchemist</strong> — Collect alchemical symbols to change your weapon's damage type. Use your special to multiply your attacks.<br></li><li><strong>Engineer</strong> — Deploy gadgets, take cover inside a shield that follows you, and summon a cannon to tear through enemies in its path.</li></ul><br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/757700/extras/256ea014859ccb94071914ed79e219d1.poster.avif?t=1793706902\" width=576 height=324 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/757700/extras/256ea014859ccb94071914ed79e219d1.webm?t=1793706902\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/757700/extras/256ea014859ccb94071914ed79e219d1.mp4?t=1793706902\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Chase your next personal best.</h2>Unlock classes and achievements, learn each playstyle, and push for a higher score on the global Steam leaderboards<br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/757700/extras/6233ce15c9255dc29cd19a1dcb5b1ed3.poster.avif?t=1793706902\" width=576 height=324 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/757700/extras/6233ce15c9255dc29cd19a1dcb5b1ed3.webm?t=1793706902\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/757700/extras/6233ce15c9255dc29cd19a1dcb5b1ed3.mp4?t=1793706902\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span>",
